# ─── Large data files (not tracked) ──────────────────────────────────────────
# The Flickr8K dataset (~1 GB of images) and pre-computed feature files
# are NOT included. Download/generate them locally (see README quick-start).
data/Flickr8k_Dataset/
data/Flickr8k_text/
data/vgg16_features.pkl
data/vgg19_features.pkl

# Keep the tokenizer for inference
!data/tokenizer.pkl

# Captions & split files that are auto-generated by preprocess.py
# (keep them out to avoid committing large text blobs)
data/captions_clean.txt
data/train_images.txt
data/val_images.txt
data/test_images.txt

# Jupyter notebooks (scratch work)
data/*.ipynb

# ─── Trained model weights ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The models are tracked via Git LFS so Streamlit Cloud can use them.
models/blip-finetuned/

# ─── Large archive files ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.zip

# ─── AI tool / agent configuration (not project code) ────────────────────────
.agents/
.claude/

# ─── Internal planning & session documents ───────────────────────────────────
# These were generated during development as scratchpads; they are not part of
# the deliverable codebase.
ACTION_PLAN.md
ANALYSIS_COMPLETE.txt
ARCHITECTURE_IMPROVEMENTS.md
EMERGENCY_READ_THIS_NOW.txt
IMPROVEMENTS_SUMMARY.md
ISSUES_SUMMARY.md
QUICKSTART.md
README_IMPROVEMENTS.md
START_HERE.md
STOP_AND_READ_THIS.md
ARCHITECTURE_COMPARISON.md

# ─── Unrelated sub-projects ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
graphify-out/
image-caption-generator/

